department-reward-department-engineering = Engineering
department-reward-engineering-start-grid-title = Stabilize the power grid
department-reward-engineering-start-grid-desc = Spin up the engine, configure the SMES units, and make sure the APCs in Command, Medbay, and Engineering are fully charged before the shift ramps up.
department-reward-engineering-start-atmos-title = Calibrate atmospherics
department-reward-engineering-start-atmos-desc = Fill the distribution loop, tune the scrubbers, and deliver fresh canisters to the engine room, Medbay, and Security.
department-reward-engineering-start-maint-title = Prep maintenance kits
department-reward-engineering-start-maint-desc = Stock EVA, Maintenance, and Field Repair lockers with tools, spare parts, and insulated gloves for the crew.
department-reward-engineering-mid-repairs-title = Seal structural breaches
department-reward-engineering-mid-repairs-desc = Respond to at least three hull breach or fire alerts and fully restore plating, walls, and infrastructure.
department-reward-engineering-mid-upgrade-title = Upgrade station infrastructure
department-reward-engineering-mid-upgrade-desc = Install upgraded machine parts or power components in three critical devices (SMES units, emitters, cloning or atmos machines).
department-reward-engineering-mid-sensors-title = Expand monitoring network
department-reward-engineering-mid-sensors-desc = Deploy sensor beacons or monitoring consoles in Engineering, Cargo, and Science so command can track pressure and power in real time.
department-reward-engineering-late-hull-title = Fortify critical hull sections
department-reward-engineering-late-hull-desc = Armor Command, AI Upload, and the engine room with reinforced walls, extra plating, and pressure doors.
department-reward-engineering-late-grid-title = Emergency grid reroute
department-reward-engineering-late-grid-desc = Lay redundant high-capacity cables and add at least two backup SMES or substations to keep the grid alive during crises.
department-reward-engineering-late-emergency-title = Emergency response drill
department-reward-engineering-late-emergency-desc = Stage portable scrubbers, power cells, and repair kits near Medbay, Brig, and EVA so the crew can respond instantly to disasters.

