ent-DepartmentRewardConsoleBase = Department Reward Console
    .desc = A terminal that issues departmental tasks and bonus payouts.
ent-DepartmentRewardConsoleCargo = Department Reward Console (Cargo)
    .desc = A supply department console for tracking tasks and bonuses.
ent-DepartmentRewardConsoleEngineering = Department Reward Console (Engineering)
    .desc = An engineering console for tracking department tasks and payouts.
ent-DepartmentRewardConsoleMaster = Department Oversight Console
    .desc = A command terminal that mirrors every departmental reward console for review.

department-reward-cargo-start-deliver-title = Refill the raw material stockpile
department-reward-cargo-start-deliver-desc = Accept and deliver three shipments of basic materials (metal, glass, or plastic) before the shift ramps up.
department-reward-cargo-start-expedition-title = Prepare the expedition shipment
department-reward-cargo-start-expedition-desc = Load three supply crates onto the expedition shuttle and dispatch them to the expedition warehouse.
department-reward-cargo-start-supply-title = Supply the station with essentials
department-reward-cargo-start-supply-desc = Send one crate of medical supplies, tools, and food to their destinations aboard the station.
department-reward-cargo-mid-vip-title = Fulfill the VIP comfort order
department-reward-cargo-mid-vip-desc = Deliver luxury food, premium alcohol, and formal wear crates to command to impress an arriving inspector.
department-reward-cargo-mid-outpost-title = Restock the frontier caches
department-reward-cargo-mid-outpost-desc = Ship engineering, salvage, and medical crates to every connected outpost shuttle before the 40-minute mark.
department-reward-cargo-mid-weaponry-title = Secure advanced weapon shipments
department-reward-cargo-mid-weaponry-desc = Assemble an order of non-lethal weapon crates and deliver them to Security for redistribution.
department-reward-cargo-late-evac-title = Prepare evacuation reserves
department-reward-cargo-late-evac-desc = Fill the emergency storage shuttle with rations, medical crates, and spare power cells for a possible evacuation.
department-reward-cargo-late-armory-title = Armory restock initiative
department-reward-cargo-late-armory-desc = Deliver laser weapon crates, riot gear, and ammunition to Security's armory to sustain a late-shift threat.
department-reward-cargo-late-centcom-title = Fulfill the CentCom tithe
department-reward-cargo-late-centcom-desc = Load a high-value goods crate (gold, plasma, uranium) and dispatch it via the shuttle to Central Command.
